docs/revision/paper-v2/main.tex:297:\caption{Prediction tally under three eligibility readings, added after external review. Numerical: the scorer's statuses (Tables~\ref{tab:predictions} and~\ref{tab:predictions-b}). Flagged inputs, Q3: a Q3 cell with a search-flagged required search, direct or through the recorded dependencies of its evaluation record, is not assessed. Flagged inputs, all non-exempt cells: a flagged scored cell is excluded in every prediction except six decision-related predictions retained by convention; a prediction fails if any eligible cell fails. An inherited flag marks a potentially relevant ancestor, not a demonstrated change. The last two rows apply the same filters to the listed inputs of each cell only, without tracing. Eighteen scored predictions, including the alternative to Q1-a.}\label{tab:pred-eligibility}
